// Action PLAY Step
// fired at a live emitter: a multichannel resolved leaf degrades to 2D in the
// play path instead of being refused, because the Action layer cannot know a
// container leaf's channel count without committing the selection a second time.
// The optional output reports that demotion to the Action caller without
// coupling this shared path to Action identity or logging.
